/File:  WINFMT.PA  Format the MDC-8 Winchester Disk

/ To run:  R WINFMT, with a floppy disk as SYS:
/ Source from WINFMT.SV octal code.  R. Larkin, Dec 1983

	*200
	CLA CLL
	6703
	JMS WAIT
	TAD (TABLE
	6704
	JMS WAIT
	6701
	JMP .-1
	6702
6707
	JMS WAIT
	6701
	JMP .-1
	6702
	NOP
	6705
	JMS WAIT
	CLA CLL
	JMP I (7600

WAIT,	HLT		/Subroutine to twiddle thumbs on
	DCA ACSAV	/  a wait loop.
	TAD TIME
	DCA COUNT
	ISZ COUNT
	JMP .-1
	TAD ACSAV
	JMP I WAIT

TABLE,	6
	0
	4
	0
	0
	13
	0
	0
TIME,	-22
ACSAV,	0
COUNT,	0
